				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Grim</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>478110</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>217 describes the end result as "organic metal", which might not actually be considered artificial. Also, it's a virus, so that might make it count as "natural". In that case, they wouldn't react at all to anything infected with it. Otherwise, they would try to disassemble any available infectees.</p> 
				 	]]>
